</div></div></div></div><div doz_type="row" doz_grid="12" doz_flexible="N" class="doz_row"><div doz_type="grid" doz_grid="12" doz_flexible="N" class="col-dz col-dz-12"><div doz_type="widget" id="w202601104751c636d096e"><div class="_widget_data  animated wg_animated  Right " data-widget-name="코드" data-widget-type="code" data-widget-anim="fadeInUp" data-widget-anim-duration="0.7" data-widget-anim-delay="0" data-widget-parent-is-mobile="N"><div class="calvin-layout-container">
    
    
    <div class="lang-selector">
        <button class="lang-btn-process active" onclick="changeLangProcess('ko')">한국어</button>
        <button class="lang-btn-process" onclick="changeLangProcess('en')">English</button>
        <button class="lang-btn-process" onclick="changeLangProcess('vn')">Tiếng Việt</button>
        <button class="lang-btn-process" onclick="changeLangProcess('uz')">O‘zbek</button>
        <button class="lang-btn-process" onclick="changeLangProcess('id')">Bahasa Indonesia</button>
        <button class="lang-btn-process" onclick="changeLangProcess('np')">नेपाली</button>
    </div>

    
    <div class="process-lang-content process-ko active">
        <div class="process-header">
            <h2>입학 진행 절차</h2>
            <p>Admission Process</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>원서 접수 및 서류 업로드</h4>
                    <p>온라인 원서 접수를 진행한 후 지원에 필요한 필수 증빙 서류를 업로드합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>면접 전형</h4>
                    <p>지원자의 소재지에 따라 국내 지원자는 대면(오프라인), 국외 지원자는 화상(온라인) 면접으로 진행됩니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>합격자 발표 및 인보이스 발급</h4>
                    <p>합격 여부를 안내하며, 합격자에게는 등록금 납부를 위한 인보이스가 발급됩니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>원본 서류 제출</h4>
                    <p>입학 심사에 필요한 모든 원본 서류를 지정된 기한 내에 대학으로 제출합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">05</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>등록금 납부</h4>
                    <p>발급된 인보이스를 확인하고 정해진 기한 내에 지정 계좌로 등록금을 납부합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">06</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>비자 서류 준비 및 신청</h4>
                    <div class="split-desc">
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>국내 지원자</strong>
                            대학을 통한 단체 비자 접수 진행
                        </div>
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>국외 지원자</strong>
                            표준입학허가서 및 비자 신청용 필수 서류 이메일 발송
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">07</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>입국 및 오리엔테이션</h4>
                    <p>개강 전 한국에 입국(국외)하거나 비자를 변경(국내)한 후, 신입생 오리엔테이션에 참석합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">08</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>개강 및 수업 참여</h4>
                    <p>학사 일정에 맞추어 정규 수업에 참여하고 본격적인 학업을 시작합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    
    <div class="process-lang-content process-en">
        <div class="process-header">
            <h2>Admission Process</h2>
            <p>Step-by-Step Guide</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Application & Document Upload</h4>
                    <p>Submit the online application and upload the required supporting documents for admission.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Interview Process</h4>
                    <p>Depending on location, interviews are conducted in-person for domestic applicants and via video for overseas applicants.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Admission Result & Invoice</h4>
                    <p>Admission results are announced, and successful applicants receive an invoice for tuition payment.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Original Document Submission</h4>
                    <p>Submit all required original documents to the university within the specified deadline.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">05</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Tuition Payment</h4>
                    <p>Check the issued invoice and pay the tuition fee to the designated account within the deadline.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">06</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Visa Preparation & Application</h4>
                    <div class="split-desc">
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Domestic Applicants</strong>
                            Group visa application processed through the university.
                        </div>
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Overseas Applicants</strong>
                            Standard Admission Letter and essential visa documents sent via email.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">07</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Entry & Orientation</h4>
                    <p>Enter Korea (overseas) or change visa status (domestic) before the semester begins, and attend orientation.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">08</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Semester Start & Classes</h4>
                    <p>Participate in regular classes according to the academic schedule and begin your studies.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    
    <div class="process-lang-content process-vn">
        <div class="process-header">
            <h2>Quy trình Nhập học</h2>
            <p>Hướng dẫn từng bước</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Nộp Đơn & Tải Tài liệu</h4>
                    <p>Nộp đơn đăng ký trực tuyến và tải lên các tài liệu chứng minh bắt buộc.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Phỏng Vấn</h4>
                    <p>Tùy theo vị trí, phỏng vấn trực tiếp cho ứng viên trong nước và phỏng vấn qua video cho ứng viên nước ngoài.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Kết quả & Cấp Hóa đơn</h4>
                    <p>Thông báo kết quả trúng tuyển và cấp hóa đơn nộp học phí cho các ứng viên đạt yêu cầu.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Nộp Tài liệu Gốc</h4>
                    <p>Nộp tất cả các tài liệu gốc cần thiết cho việc xét tuyển về trường trong thời hạn quy định.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">05</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Nộp Học phí</h4>
                    <p>Kiểm tra hóa đơn được cấp và nộp học phí vào tài khoản chỉ định trong thời gian quy định.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">06</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Chuẩn bị & Đăng ký Visa</h4>
                    <div class="split-desc">
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Ứng viên trong nước</strong>
                            Đăng ký visa theo nhóm thông qua trường đại học.
                        </div>
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Ứng viên nước ngoài</strong>
                            Thư nhập học tiêu chuẩn và giấy tờ visa được gửi qua email.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">07</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Nhập cảnh & Định hướng</h4>
                    <p>Nhập cảnh Hàn Quốc (nước ngoài) hoặc chuyển đổi visa (trong nước) trước khi khai giảng và tham gia định hướng.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">08</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Bắt đầu Học kỳ & Lớp học</h4>
                    <p>Tham gia các lớp học chính thức theo lịch trình học tập và bắt đầu khóa học của bạn.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    
    <div class="process-lang-content process-uz">
        <div class="process-header">
            <h2>Qabul Qilish Jarayoni</h2>
            <p>Qadamma-qadam qo'llanma</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Ariza va Hujjatlarni Yuklash</h4>
                    <p>Onlayn arizani topshiring va qabul qilish uchun kerakli tasdiqlovchi hujjatlarni yuklang.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Suhbat Jarayoni</h4>
                    <p>Joylashuviga qarab, suhbatlar Koreyadagilar uchun yuzma-yuz, chet eldagi arizachilar uchun video orqali o'tkaziladi.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Qabul Natijasi va Invoys</h4>
                    <p>Qabul natijalari e'lon qilinadi va muvaffaqiyatli o'tganlarga o'qish to'lovi uchun invoys beriladi.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Asl Hujjatlarni Topshirish</h4>
                    <p>Qabul tekshiruvi uchun barcha kerakli asl hujjatlarni belgilangan muddatda universitetga topshiring.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">05</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>O'qish To'lovi</h4>
                    <p>Berilgan invoysni tekshiring va belgilangan muddatda ko'rsatilgan hisob raqamiga to'lovni amalga oshiring.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">06</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Viza Tayyorlash va Topshirish</h4>
                    <div class="split-desc">
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Koreyadagi arizachilar</strong>
                            Universitet orqali guruhli viza arizasi topshiriladi.
                        </div>
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Chet eldagi arizachilar</strong>
                            Standart qabul xati va viza hujjatlari elektron pochta orqali yuboriladi.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">07</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Kirish va Orientatsiya</h4>
                    <p>Semestr boshlanishidan oldin Koreyaga kiring yoki vizangizni o'zgartiring va orientatsiyada qatnashing.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">08</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Darslar Boshlanishi</h4>
                    <p>Akademik taqvimga muvofiq muntazam darslarda qatnashing va o'qishni boshlang.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    
    <div class="process-lang-content process-id">
        <div class="process-header">
            <h2>Proses Penerimaan</h2>
            <p>Panduan Langkah demi Langkah</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Aplikasi & Unggah Dokumen</h4>
                    <p>Kirimkan aplikasi secara online dan unggah dokumen pendukung yang diperlukan untuk penerimaan.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Proses Wawancara</h4>
                    <p>Tergantung lokasi, wawancara dilakukan secara tatap muka (domestik) atau melalui video (luar negeri).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Hasil Penerimaan & Tagihan</h4>
                    <p>Hasil diumumkan, dan pelamar yang berhasil akan menerima tagihan untuk pembayaran biaya kuliah.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Penyerahan Dokumen Asli</h4>
                    <p>Serahkan semua dokumen asli yang dipersyaratkan ke universitas dalam batas waktu yang ditentukan.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">05</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Pembayaran Biaya Kuliah</h4>
                    <p>Periksa tagihan yang diterbitkan dan lakukan pembayaran ke rekening yang ditunjuk tepat waktu.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">06</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Persiapan & Aplikasi Visa</h4>
                    <div class="split-desc">
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Pelamar Domestik</strong>
                            Aplikasi visa grup diproses melalui universitas.
                        </div>
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>Pelamar Luar Negeri</strong>
                            Surat Penerimaan Standar dan dokumen visa dikirim via email.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">07</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Kedatangan & Orientasi</h4>
                    <p>Masuk ke Korea (luar negeri) atau ubah status visa (domestik) sebelum semester dimulai, dan hadiri orientasi.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">08</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>Awal Semester & Kelas</h4>
                    <p>Berpartisipasi dalam kelas reguler sesuai dengan jadwal akademik dan mulai perkuliahan Anda.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    
    <div class="process-lang-content process-np">
        <div class="process-header">
            <h2>भर्ना प्रक्रिया</h2>
            <p>चरण-दर-चरण गाइड</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-grid">
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>आवेदन र कागजात अपलोड</h4>
                    <p>अनलाइन आवेदन पेश गर्नुहोस् र भर्नाको लागि आवश्यक प्रमाण कागजातहरू अपलोड गर्नुहोस्।</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>अन्तर्वार्ता प्रक्रिया</h4>
                    <p>स्थानको आधारमा, कोरियामा रहेकाहरूका लागि प्रत्यक्ष र विदेशमा रहेकाहरूका लागि भिडियो मार्फत अन्तर्वार्ता गरिन्छ।</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>भर्ना परिणाम र इनभ्वाइस</h4>
                    <p>भर्ना परिणामहरू घोषणा गरिन्छ, र सफल आवेदकहरूलाई ट्युसन भुक्तानीको लागि इनभ्वाइस प्रदान गरिन्छ।</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>मूल कागजात पेश</h4>
                    <p>परीक्षणको लागि आवश्यक सबै मूल कागजातहरू तोकिएको समयसीमा भित्र विश्वविद्यालयमा पेश गर्नुहोस्।</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">05</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>ट्युसन भुक्तानी</h4>
                    <p>जारी गरिएको इनभ्वाइस जाँच गर्नुहोस् र तोकिएको समयसीमा भित्र तोकिएको खातामा ट्युसन शुल्क भुक्तानी गर्नुहोस्।</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">06</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>भिसा तयारी र आवेदन</h4>
                    <div class="split-desc">
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>कोरियामा रहेका आवेदकहरू</strong>
                            विश्वविद्यालय मार्फत समूह भिसा आवेदन प्रक्रिया।
                        </div>
                        <div class="split-item">
                            <strong>विदेशमा रहेका आवेदकहरू</strong>
                            मानक भर्ना पत्र र भिसा कागजातहरू इमेल मार्फत पठाइन्छ।
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">07</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>प्रवेश र अभिमुखीकरण</h4>
                    <p>सेमेस्टर सुरु हुनु अघि कोरिया प्रवेश गर्नुहोस् वा भिसा स्थिति परिवर्तन गर्नुहोस्, र अभिमुखीकरणमा भाग लिनुहोस्।</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="process-card">
                <div class="step-num">08</div>
                <div class="process-content">
                    <h4>कक्षा सुरु</h4>
                    <p>शैक्षिक तालिका अनुसार नियमित कक्षाहरूमा भाग लिनुहोस् र आफ्नो अध्ययन सुरु गर्नुहोस्।</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>



</div></div></div></div><div doz_type="row" doz_grid="12" doz_flexible="N" class="doz_row"><div doz_type="grid" doz_grid="12" doz_flexible="N" class="col-dz col-dz-12"><div doz_type="widget" id="w2022101095edf428c09c4"><div class="_widget_data " data-widget-name="텍스트" data-widget-type="text" data-widget-anim="none" data-widget-anim-duration="0.7" data-widget-anim-delay="0" data-widget-parent-is-mobile="N">	<div doz_type="text" class="widget _text_wrap widget_text_wrap fr-view  default_padding " id="text_w2022101095edf428c09c4" >
		<div class="text-table "><div><p>원서접수는 온라인으로 이루어집니다. 입학안내 페이지에 상세한 안내가 있습니다.&nbsp;</p><p>Applications must be submitted online. There is an online link in the Notice of Application Guide at the bottom of this page.</p></div></div>
	</div>
	
</div></div></div></div><div doz_type="row" doz_grid="12" doz_flexible="N" class="doz_row"><div doz_type="grid" doz_grid="12" doz_flexible="N" class="col-dz col-dz-12"><div doz_type="widget" id="w20260110fdf6a4e5ef30f"><div class="_widget_data _ds_animated_except" data-widget-name="여백" data-widget-type="padding"    data-widget-parent-is-mobile="N"><div class="widget padding" data-height="30" style="margin-top:px; margin-bottom:px;">
